    "description": "Vintage Tobacco Smoking Pipes Collection with Wooden Pipe Rack Briar Corn Cob\nOverview:\nThis vintage collection features a variety of tobacco smoking pipes displayed on a wooden pipe rack. The pipes are crafted from different materials and exhibit a range of finishes and stem designs.\nSpecifications:\nMaterials: Briar wood, corn cob, and other wood types\nFinishes: Smooth, polished, rusticated\nBrands: Includes marked pipes such as Parker, John Surrey Ltd., Town and Country and others with engravings\nRack: Wooden pipe rack with minor surface wear\nAdditional Details:\nThe pipes have unique shapes and colors with darkened bowls and visible signs of prior use. The wooden rack is designed to hold multiple pipes and is constructed from wood with typical surface wear.\nAll items are pre-owned and described as accurately as possible, however we are not experts in any field. Please feel free to contact us with any additional questions.\nYour purchase allows Goodwill Industries-Suncoast to fulfill our mission of transforming lives through lifelong learning and the power of work while seeking ways to enhance our communities’ environmental resources.\nThis mission is accomplished through employment services, training programs, and affordable housing. The sale of donated goods enables Goodwill Industries-Suncoast to offer a variety of employment and training services, promote self-sufficiency, and contribute to community conservation through recycling.\nThank you for your support!",
